      "cooked": "<p><br>Wager master has a Condition card which causes all the players to shuffle one of their cards into his deck. I can't remember the name of the card at the moment. My question is: What happens if that Condition is flipped face down and one of the hero cards is on top of Wager Master's deck when it comes time for him to play a card? I the hero's card played? If so, where?</p>",
