      "id": 174215,
      "name": "Matchstickman",
      "username": "Matchstickman",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-04-20T15:33:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Wager Master does not have a Condition that does this, it has an Indestructible Ongoing that does this. The card can never be flipped face down so the situation you describe can never happen and the text on the Ongoing will always trigger when a hero card is on top of Wager Master's deck.</p>",
